Sized decorator layers (patch 0025) with an origin box apart from their paint box, and rounded clipping: a layer is
sized and placed in its origin box (CSS background-origin, an optional fourth `/ <box>` part) and painted in its paint
box (background-clip), which may extend past it; a rounded paint box clips the layer under that box's clip mask.
CSS Backgrounds 3: https://www.w3.org/TR/css-backgrounds-3/#background-origin

